Subject: [PATCH] arm64: dts: exynos8895: restore dream2lte codec mono outputs

The CS47L93 uses the board's OUT3 and OUT4 mono routing. Describe
the Samsung wiring so the codec driver installs both selectable
paths for the OUT3 Mono Mux.

diff --git a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts
--- a/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts
+++ b/arch/arm64/boot/dts/exynos/exynos8895-dream2lteks.dts
@@ -483,6 +483,7 @@
 				  MADERA_DMIC_REF_MICBIAS1
 				  MADERA_DMIC_REF_MICBIAS1
 				  MADERA_DMIC_REF_MICVDD>;
+		cirrus,out-mono = <0 0 1 1 0 0>;
 		spi-max-frequency = <25000000>;
 		interrupts-extended = <&gpa2 6 IRQ_TYPE_LEVEL_LOW>;
 		reset-gpios = <&gpe7 0 GPIO_ACTIVE_LOW>;
